secrets/
# Anchored to the repo root: unanchored "private/" also matched (case-insensitively on
# Windows) every plugin's Source/**/Private/ folder, silently hiding real, tracked-looking
# module source (.cpp/.h) from git ls-files -- found via the TTD canon migration's
# manifest-based cross-repo link check (2026-07-23).
/private/

